OL,3,GNEWSAGoats drafted in to tame Greenwich
OL,4,APark slope
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park in south-east London has taken
OL,7,Fon some new groundskeepers, and they
OL,8,Fare more than happy to eat on the job.
OL,10,FA small herd of rare Bagot goats has
OL,11,Fbeen brought in to clear a steep,
OL,12,Fovergrown slope below the Royal
OL,13,FObservatory in Greenwich Park, in a
OL,14,Ftrial run by The Royal Parks charity.
OL,16,FOver five days the animals will chomp
OL,17,Fthrough tough, woody plants and thorny
OL,18,Fstems on Castle Hill Bank, a patch that
OL,19,Fis hard to reach with machinery or by
OL,20,Fhand.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
